# Fluid API host. LEAVE UNSET for local development: `fluid portal dev`
# forces requests same-origin and resolves the signed-in company's tenant BFF
# (`https://<subdomain>.portal.fluid.app`). Setting an absolute URL here only
# changes which API the dev proxy targets; it does not create an authenticated
# portal-member handoff session.
# VITE_API_URL=

# Optional: override the Fluid CLI auth token for this project.
# Takes effect when running `pnpm pull`, `pnpm push`, etc.
# Alternatively, set the "profile" field in .fluidrc (committed to the repo).
# FLUID_TOKEN=
